      "id": "claim_94f228e67cb14c1a96bd6c1ca3df4c63",
      "statement": "LEDGER scores a generated wiki by replaying Git checkpoints, running OpenWiki at each, and reducing every current factual claim into one of supported, stale, invented, or unverified states that share a single snapshot denominator.",
