    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fede7c57f2ac4de7a98af67900e0b2a6",
      "statement": "The four claim rates (supported, staleness, hallucination, unverified) are each count / total over current-tense claims, recomputed per checkpoint from the entire current wiki rather than as a delta or average, and total is the shared denominator.",
