    {
      "id": "claim_b786169b497b4d26ad00199fbc27a8fb",
      "statement": "The precision pass classifies Markdown text units, extracts atomic claims with verbatim sourceQuote provenance, deduplicates by a conservative normalized key, and grounds claims against current evidence first, consulting historical evidence only after a current contradiction to split stale from invented.",
