    {
      "id": "claim_e2517411e9b74b738181269bde9031b1",
      "statement": "A benchmark comprises a source Git repository, an ordered frozen trace of pinned checkpoint SHAs, an author-declared difficulty (easy/medium/hard, never computed), and an optional reviewed semantic evidence map that is evaluator-only routing metadata never exposed to the System Under Test.",
