    {
      "id": "claim_69c40cef12bd491dac3f0a61e42acb81",
      "statement": "runBenchmark preflight-validates the trace (every SHA resolves, each checkpoint is a Git ancestor of the next, nothing under openwiki/ is tracked), then walks the trace calling system.init at index 0 and system.update at later indices, capturing an immutable artifact and current+historical evidence per checkpoint before evaluateCheckpoint.",
