    {
      "id": "claim_2774917056ab4cde801fc0a05f5645e4",
      "statement": "The forgetting watch set is sticky: an obsolete fact version stays under watch for every later checkpoint and is retired only when the requirements revive it, so a version already judged forgotten is still re-checked later, which is what lets the Stale-Knowledge Lifetime diagnostic measure lingering.",
