    {
      "id": "claim_9768fe565e7f433e999931ab2eb9d247",
      "statement": "The OpenWiki system adapter is the baseline SystemUnderTest that drives OpenWiki through its runOpenWikiAgent entrypoint with outputMode repository so the worktree cwd is honored, sets OPENWIKI_PROVIDER/OPENWIKI_MODEL_ID before each run, and never passes a user message so update change-detection is driven purely by source deltas.",
