    {
      "id": "claim_f26bf5eb32b04bfdb4d2abdc82262048",
      "statement": "The LEDGER run-level score is opportunity-weighted claim health: supported current claims divided by all current claims across checkpoints, computed by summing supported and total per CheckpointResult; stale, invented, and unverified all lower it because they remain in the denominator.",
